{
  "id": "dongmanmanhua",
  "name": "咚漫漫画 LINE WEBTOON",
  "lang": "cn",
  "note": "详情页是 /<题材>/<拼音>/list?title_no=<id>（如 /LOVE/dibaodebaizhou/list?title_no=2892），章节页是 /<题材>/<拼音>/<第N话>/viewer?title_no=<id>&episode_no=<n>。viewer 页正文图放在 <img class=\"_images _centerImg\" data-url=\"...\">，src 是占位图 bg_transparency.png，所以必须用 pages.attr=data-url + filter 指向 cdn.dongmanmanhua.cn。章节列表分页 ?page=N。｜本版不支持站内搜索（搜索结果由 /js/search.js 的 jindo 组件异步请求填充，SSR 页面里没有任何作品链接）；可在搜索页用「打开网址…」直接粘贴作品页地址下载。 默认不在界面列表里展示（hidden: true）。",
  "domains": [
    "dongmanmanhua.cn",
    "www.dongmanmanhua.cn",
    "m.dongmanmanhua.cn",
    "dongmanmanhua.com",
    "www.dongmanmanhua.com"
  ],
  "search_url": "",
  "headers": {
    "Accept-Language": "zh-CN,zh;q=0.9"
  },
  "comic": {
    "title": {
      "css": "h1.subj",
      "text": true
    },
    "author": {
      "css": "span.author",
      "text": true
    },
    "cover": {
      "css": "meta[property='og:image']",
      "attr": "content"
    },
    "description": {
      "css": "p.summary",
      "text": true
    },
    "status": {
      "css": "p.day_info",
      "text": true
    }
  },
  "chapters": {
    "list": {
      "css": "a[href*='/viewer']"
    },
    "url": {
      "attr": "href"
    },
    "url_re": "episode_no=\\d+",
    "next": {
      "css": "a[href*='page=']",
      "attr": "href"
    },
    "paginated": true,
    "max_pages": 30
  },
  "pages": {
    "list": {
      "css": "img._centerImg"
    },
    "attr": "data-url",
    "filter": "^https?://cdn\\.dongmanmanhua\\.cn/.*\\.(?:jpg|jpeg|png|webp)(?:\\?|$)"
  },
  "hidden": true
}
